    "title": "Pulte Homes subdivision to be considered by Zionsville Town Council next month - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Spencer Durham ,\n8 hours ago A proposed subdivision by Pulte Homes on 300 South will be heard by the Zionsville Town Council at its June 1 meeting. Pulte Homes seeks to rezone 140 acres along 300 South between 800 and 875 East from Rural Single-Family (R1) to Rural Single and Two-Family (R2). The Zionsville Plan Commission narrowly voted, 4-3, to give the rezone a favorable recommendation April 21. The Zionsville Town Council continued the matter May 4. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
